  description: "(This card is also always treated as a \"Blaze Accelerator\" card.)\r\nOne
    \"The Winged Dragon of Ra\" you control gains the following effects until the
    end of this turn. This card's activation and effect cannot be negated.\r\n\u25CF
    This card is unaffected by your opponent's card effects.\r\n\u25CF When an attack
    is declared involving this card: You can Tribute any number of other monsters
    that did not declare an attack this turn; this card gains ATK equal to the Tributed
    monsters' combined original ATK, until the end of this turn.\r\n\u25CF After
    damage calculation, if this card attacked: You can send all monsters your opponent
    controls to the GY."
